<title>FRANCE: Suez says supports Axa/UAP merger.</title>
<headline>Suez says supports Axa/UAP merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez supports a planned merger of French insurers Axa and UAP, a Suez spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We support the deal,&quot; she told Reuters. &quot;It's a good deal.&quot;</p>
<p>Suez holds 4.9 percent of UAP, the company's 1995 annual report shows.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
